      "message": "service-connectivity uses R8 which will automatically strip out unused classes; so you can just use \"net-utils-device-common-struct\" which already contains these structs.\n\nGenerally for libraries included in service-connectivity, the intent is to limit the number of individual libs, and instead include a big lib that has all that is OK to use, using R8 to strip out what is unnecessary.",
